-
-**Step 2**: Run the deployment command
-
-```bash
-python3 ./easy-install.py deploy \
-    --project=crm_prod_setup \
-    --email=email.example.com \
-    --image=ghcr.io/frappe/crm \
-    --version=stable \
-    --app=crm \
-    --sitename subdomain.domain.tld
-```
